(D1 — Discrepancy 1 repro: a conditional value return (factorial pattern,
 no `Return` on the `To` line) that returns a NUMBER literal from a frame
 whose value parameter holds a TEXT used to segfault the runtime, exit 139,
 deterministic 6/6. LANGUAGE.md 0.4.7 (:2570-2574) described the whole
 construct as a limitation — "the value would print as a number" — but in
 this direction it crashed.
