 `Otherwise` branch returns 99 and it prints 99. LANGUAGE.md was updated in
 the same change and now documents the construct as working ("Conditional
 `value` returns work", :2626-2639) with this exact program as its example;
 running the manual's version verbatim prints `7` then `99`.
